  "background": "Published in 1969 by Deccan College Postgraduate and Research Institute in Poona (Publication No. 67) by linguist D. N. S. Bhat. Consists of xii + 100 pages detailing the phonology and lexical elicitation collected from a native speaker from Hunphun (the ancestral parent village of Ukhrul). Features rigorous structuralist phonemic notation, tonal descriptions, and comparative glottal analysis.",
